# Root .dockerignore for massive Docker build speed optimization
# Stops transferring hundreds of MBs of local node_modules, venvs, and git history to Docker daemon

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.env*
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
hosting/
DEMO_SCRIPT.md
azure_deploy.sh
walkthrough.md
implementation_plan.md
task.md
